{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-23T08:22:04.807Z","author":"codex-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6.1-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"cf73d9707128820a198a2441","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6.1-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"high","source":"probe"},"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/8","value":{"created_at":"2026-10-23T08:22:04.807Z","author":"codex-agent","text":"Final follow-up verification: node --test --experimental-test-coverage --test-coverage-include=shadow.ts test/shadow.test.ts passes 25/25 with 100% lines/branches/functions for shadow.ts. Restored four requested regressions pass 4/4 with Git absent from PATH and an explicit discovery ceiling. Independent revert commands use node --test --test-name-pattern with the exact prefixes review regression: identical actions; review regression: a consented original zero-budget; review regression: an original tampered disagreement; review regression: a manifest cohort grown. Reverting only validateObservation to accept stored rows fails the reward and disagreement cases 1/1 each; reverting only validateDeployment to retain consent without cohort/budget checks fails the budget and expanded-cohort cases 1/1 each, all with Missing expected rejection. Source restored. Pinned linked-test execution passes 1/1; typecheck, test typecheck, lint, zero duplication and docstrings pass. Repacked public acceptance on the existing read-only source copy reproduces docs/shadow-evidence.json byte-for-byte. PR https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rl/pull/99 will carry the exact pushed-head npm/Bun CI run and counts; previous-head gates are historical only. Claim released for orchestrator verification; item remains in progress."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-23T08:22:04.807Z"}],"before_hash":"8b64a4088224bf77f48234005cd043f5299746539ece25d729f187d479e600d7